# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character (`—`, U+2014) in any writing: UI copy, marketing, Reddit/social posts, comments, commit messages, README, or docs.

## Use instead

- Comma, period, or semicolon
- Colon for "here's what follows"
- Parentheses for asides
- A spaced hyphen (` - `) only if you truly need a dash pause

```text
Bad:  Guests join with a PIN — they don't need a subscription.
Good: Guests join with a PIN. They don't need a subscription.
Good: Guests join with a PIN (they don't need a subscription).
```

Also avoid copying em dashes from other docs into this repo. If you see one while editing, replace it.
